<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates at 6.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates at 6.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar stood at 6.77 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in 14 reported transactions with a total value of 18.05 million dinars ($25 million).</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
